# Terminal progress bar test: the bar as its timer fills it.
# The bar's timer ticks once a second from the start of the chapter,
# and a wait's own end counts with the test as a tick more. The waits are
# cut so that five ticks fall in each of the first three, a step's settling
# and capture, a third of a second, falls between two ticks, and no wait
# ends on one: the bar stands at 6, 12 and 18 of 20, and in the last wait
# it fills, says so, and is set back to 11 by the wait's end
sync 24
wait 5400
wait 4660
wait 4660
wait 2500
enter

# Graphical progress bar test: the same
sync 25
wait 5400
wait 4660
wait 4660
wait 2500
enter

